.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH SPT-TUNNEL 1  "tunnel " 
.SH NAME
tunnel \- Run, inspect, and control tunnels
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtunnel\fR [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fIsubcommands\fR>
.SH DESCRIPTION
Run, inspect, and control tunnels
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH SUBCOMMANDS
.TP
tunnel\-run(1)
Run configured tunnels
.TP
tunnel\-status(1)
Show overall tunnel status
.TP
tunnel\-stats(1)
Live or one\-shot stats
.TP
tunnel\-sessions(1)
List active sessions
.TP
tunnel\-stop(1)
Stop tunnels
.TP
tunnel\-reload(1)
Reload running configuration
.TP
tunnel\-health(1)
Health summary
.TP
tunnel\-failover(1)
Manually trigger failover for a profile
.TP
tunnel\-help(1)
Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)
.SH EXTRA
EXAMPLES:
  spt tunnel run \-\-foreground
  spt tunnel run \-\-once \-\-profiles edge,backup
  spt tunnel status \-\-watch \-\-json
  spt tunnel failover edge \-\-to dr \-\-reason "primary degraded"
  spt tunnel reload \-\-wait
